{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301041","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301041","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1430104101:1":{"text":"窯だよ！","source_cn":"做烤鸡最重要的当然是火炉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BFDD6C52A6F54D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430104102:1":{"text":"オルディン村では、七面鳥は窯焼きにするの！","source_cn":"在我们深岩村，火鸡只有用火炉闷烤这一种做法!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A2028EFF4735858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430104103:1":{"text":"ここの粘土と地熱で作った窯は、上質な武器だけじゃなくて――","source_cn":"我们这里的黏土和地热协作出的火炉，不仅能锻造优质的武器——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C42F643077C9C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430104104:1":{"text":"表はカリッと、中はジューシーな七面鳥まで作れちゃうんだから！","source_cn":"还能做出外皮微微焦脆，内里肉质鲜嫩且锁住油水的火鸡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14631C6A1D265C10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人葛文娜":{"text":"ドワーフのグウェンナ","source":"矮人葛文娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}